AI-Powered Career Guidance App
Short verdict: Highly feasible, but needs strategic phasing. The vision is strong and the market gap is real — but trying to build everything at once would be injudicious (meaning: lacking good judgment; unwise).

✅ What's Strong

Clear target audience — 10th/12th students + parents is a well-defined, large market
Real pain point — Post-result confusion is a genuine, recurring problem in India
USP is solid — "Google Maps for Career" is a compelling differentiator
Monetization paths are multiple and realistic


⚠️ Feasibility Concerns
AreaConcernSuggestionScope13 features for v1 is too broadBuild MVP with 3–4 core featuresAI AccuracyCareer prediction AI needs quality training dataStart with rule-based logic + GPT API, train laterCollege DataReal-time fee, cutoff, placement data is hard to maintainPartner with Shiksha/Collegedunia APIs initiallyRegional Language AIHindi/Marathi AI responses need fine-tuningEnglish + Hindi first, expand laterGamificationSpin wheels, mini-games need heavy frontend effortUse proven libraries (Framer Motion, Lottie)

🗺️ Recommended Build Phases
Phase 1 — MVP (3–4 months)

Interest assessment (gamified quiz)
AI career recommendations via GPT API
Basic career roadmap visualization
AI chatbot mentor

Phase 2 — Growth (2–3 months)

Parent mode
College recommendation with real data
Scholarship finder

Phase 3 — Scale

Day-in-the-life simulations
Full multilingual support
School/counselor B2B dashboard


🛠️ Tech Stack Recommendation

Frontend: React + Tailwind (Web) + React Native (Mobile) — one codebase approach
Backend: Node.js + PostgreSQL
AI: Claude/GPT API for chatbot + recommendations
Career Data: Curate your own JSON dataset initially (100–150 careers)
Flowcharts: React Flow library (perfect for roadmap visualization)


💡 Key Suggestions

Don't build the AI model from scratch — use existing LLM APIs with smart prompting. That's 80% of the work done.
Content is your real moat — career data, salary ranges, exam details. Invest here.
Start B2C, then go B2B — schools and coaching centers are high revenue but slow sales cycles
Validate with 50 students first before full build — run the assessment as a simple Google Form + WhatsApp consultation


